{"unit_id":"FenrirCait__dsh-fail-guard#card-zh","repo":"FenrirCait/dsh-fail-guard","commit":"45549f25b44132faef0c1d8b6b5b06332c6b07cb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fail-guard 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的连续失败停手守卫。它监听 agent 会话中的工具调用和结果，识别工具错误或非零 shell 退出码，并按会话累计连续失败；达到可配置阈值后，通过 agent.steer 发送要求说明尝试、错误、初步原因和所需用户操作的停手指令。成功结果会清零计数，也可配置是否只累计同一工具。插件还提供配置面板，可调整阈值、指令文本、摘要与诊断日志选项，适合希望 agent 在重复失败后先汇报而非继续尝试的场景。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:129-187","lib/client.js:208-358"]}
{"unit_id":"FenrirCait__dsh-fail-guard#card-en","repo":"FenrirCait/dsh-fail-guard","commit":"45549f25b44132faef0c1d8b6b5b06332c6b07cb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-fail-guard helps a DSH web agent stop after repeated tool failures. It counts errors per session and uses agent.steer to request a report when the configurable threshold is reached. Success resets the count. A settings panel controls the threshold, stop message, and diagnostic logging.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:129-187","lib/client.js:208-358"]}
