{"unit_id":"FenrirCait__dsh-fail-guard#feature-1","repo":"FenrirCait/dsh-fail-guard","commit":"45549f25b44132faef0c1d8b6b5b06332c6b07cb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fail-guard 的功能「连续失败后叫停」：监听工具调用结果，并将错误按会话累计；达到阈值后通过 steer 发送停手指令，成功结果会清零计数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:137-187"]}
