{"unit_id":"FenrirCait__dsh-fail-guard#feature-5","repo":"FenrirCait/dsh-fail-guard","commit":"45549f25b44132faef0c1d8b6b5b06332c6b07cb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fail-guard 的功能「诊断日志」：启用 debug 后将事件、连续计数与触发信息追加写入配置路径；写入失败会被捕获，不影响主体处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:110-119","lib/index.js:186-187"]}
